WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:12.857
"Go ahead, Ezra.

2
00:00:13.077 --> 00:00:14.998
Tell us your idea," Glen said.

3
00:00:15.018 --> 00:00:19.960
"What if we added extra weight to the other teams' canoes?"

4
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.020
Ezra said.

5
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.121
"That would slow them down."

6
00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:25.542
"But how can we do that?"

7
00:00:26.082 --> 00:00:26.722
Ivy asked.

8
00:00:27.503 --> 00:00:30.324
"There's no place to hide anything heavy in a canoe."

9
00:00:31.988 --> 00:00:35.371
"There's a rope tied to the front of each canoe," Ezra said.

10
00:00:35.391 --> 00:00:40.536
"What if we tied a rock to the other teams' canoes with that rope?"

11
00:00:42.017 --> 00:00:44.399
"That's an incredible idea!"

12
00:00:44.699 --> 00:00:45.320
Glen said.

13
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.802
Ivy chuckled.

14
00:00:48.343 --> 00:00:49.764
"Not bad, Ezra.

15
00:00:50.845 --> 00:00:53.127
Especially from someone who doesn't want to cheat."

16
00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:55.469
Ezra frowned.

17
00:00:55.489 --> 00:00:58.532
"I wish we didn't have to cheat.

18
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:02.042
But we're terrible at canoeing.

19
00:01:02.823 --> 00:01:04.384
Cheating is our only hope."

20
00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:07.026
They headed toward the lake.

21
00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:12.491
"Let's look for some heavy rocks," Glen said.

22
00:01:13.932 --> 00:01:17.014
They walked through the woods until they found two large rocks.

23
00:01:18.796 --> 00:01:21.358
Glen carried one and Ezra picked up the other.

24
00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:24.300
The rocks were very heavy.

25
00:01:25.722 --> 00:01:28.344
After a few minutes, Glen dropped his rock.

26
00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:32.341
"It's a long way to the lake with these heavy rocks.

27
00:01:33.181 --> 00:01:34.682
Why don't you take a turn, Ivy."

28
00:01:34.702 --> 00:01:38.464
"I just got out of the infirmary, remember?"

29
00:01:38.904 --> 00:01:39.564
Ivy snapped.

30
00:01:39.584 --> 00:01:41.465
"Do you want me to faint again?"

31
00:01:43.106 --> 00:01:44.166
She walked ahead of them.

32
00:01:44.186 --> 00:01:47.768
"You weren't really sick!"

33
00:01:48.168 --> 00:01:48.828
Glen yelled.

34
00:01:48.848 --> 00:01:51.189
"Get back here and help me!"

35
00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.090
Ivy looked over her shoulder.

36
00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:58.252
"Why don't you roll the rocks instead of carrying them?"

37
00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:01.793
"You think you're so smart!"

38
00:02:01.993 --> 00:02:02.893
Glen shot back.

39
00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:06.194
Then he looked at his rock and rolled it forward.

40
00:02:06.214 --> 00:02:08.734
"Okay, it sort of works."

41
00:02:10.515 --> 00:02:13.796
Ezra and Glen rolled the rocks through the grass until they reached the lake.

42
00:02:15.576 --> 00:02:17.837
There were lots of campers swimming and canoeing.

43
00:02:18.717 --> 00:02:21.438
Larry and Penelope were the counselors on duty again.

44
00:02:22.678 --> 00:02:24.699
The friends rolled the rocks under a tree.

45
00:02:27.099 --> 00:02:28.780
Ezra wiped sweat from his forehead.

46
00:02:30.372 --> 00:02:33.334
"Maybe my idea wasn't so great.

47
00:02:34.415 --> 00:02:38.178
How can we tie the rocks to the canoes with all these people around?"

48
00:02:39.619 --> 00:02:43.202
Glen looked at the row of empty canoes tied to the dock and smiled.

49
00:02:43.222 --> 00:02:46.064
"Leave that part to me."

50
00:02:47.905 --> 00:02:48.605
Ivy groaned.

51
00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:51.227
"Do we have to?"

52
00:02:54.169 --> 00:02:57.472
Early the next morning, the three friends followed Glen's plan.

53
00:02:58.944 --> 00:03:01.566
They sneaked down to the lake before morning assembly.

54
00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:06.588
Then they rolled the two rocks out to the dock and dropped them into the water.

55
00:03:08.169 --> 00:03:09.170
Ezra looked nervous.

56
00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:13.452
"We have to hurry back to assembly before Private catches us."

57
00:03:14.993 --> 00:03:16.193
"Right," Glen said.

58
00:03:16.213 --> 00:03:20.936
"Then, as soon as it's over, we'll come back to finish the job."

59
00:03:20.956 --> 00:03:24.638
"I hope this works," Ivy said.

60
00:03:25.719 --> 00:03:27.980
Glen's plan didn't seem very smart to her.

61
00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.241
But she couldn't think of anything better.

62
00:03:33.723 --> 00:03:37.805
Later, after activities started, they were back at the lake in swimsuits.

63
00:03:39.426 --> 00:03:40.807
They walked out onto the dock.

64
00:03:40.827 --> 00:03:44.549
"Are you sure you can do this?"

65
00:03:45.089 --> 00:03:45.930
Ivy asked Glen.

66
00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:48.812
"The water is really deep."

67
00:03:48.832 --> 00:03:51.213
"Of course!"

68
00:03:51.513 --> 00:03:52.154
Glen said.

69
00:03:52.174 --> 00:03:55.756
"All I have to do is dive in and find our rocks.

70
00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.581
I'll pick one up and tie it to a canoe with the rope.

71
00:04:00.482 --> 00:04:03.743
Then I'll come up for air, dive down, and find the second one.

72
00:04:04.383 --> 00:04:10.906
Easy-peasy!" "Do you see our rocks down there?"

73
00:04:11.346 --> 00:04:12.047
Ezra asked.

74
00:04:17.529 --> 00:04:20.050
but they're down there somewhere," Glen said.

75
00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.011
"Trust me.

76
00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:23.212
I got this."

77
00:04:26.784 --> 00:04:29.647
Glen dived off the dock and disappeared underwater.

78
00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.712
Ivy and Ezra watched and waited.

79
00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:40.359
"He's been underwater an awfully long time," Ezra said nervously.

80
00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.403
They kept watching the water, waiting for Glen to appear.
